.TH LOOPING 1 "September 2026" "Looping 2.1.0" "Looping Manual"
.SH NAME
looping \- High-performance declarative language & multimedia engine for Shine Loop Console
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B looping
[\fIOPTION\fR]... [\fIFILE\fR]
.br
.B looping
\fBrepl\fR
.br
.B looping
\fBbuild\fR \fIFILE\fR [\fB-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Looping is the official language and runtime designed by Holo Entertainment (Coki Studios) for creating 60 FPS 2D video games, GUI applications, and Python-integrated multimedia experiences.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-gui ", " \-g
Launch the script in a native 60 FPS viewport window.
.TP
.BR \-\-apk " \fIFILE\fR [\fB-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR]"
Package a .loop game into a standalone Android APK.
.TP
.BR build ", " compile " \fIFILE\fR [\fB-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR]"
Compile the script to a standalone HTML5/DirectX executable.
.TP
.BR repl
Launch the interactive live Looping shell with auto-eval and memory inspector.
.TP
.BR eval " \fICODE\fR"
Evaluate an inline Looping expression or script.
.TP
.BR \-\-version ", " \-v
Print Looping engine version information.
.SH AUTHOR
Holo Entertainment / Coki Studios (support@cokistudios.com)
